# Food for Thought (windurst 14): Kenapa-Keppa, Kerutoto, Ohbiru-Dohbiru and Leepe-Hoppe in Windurst Waters. Fame 0 (so
# Overnight Delivery is never offered here). Available: Kerutoto's 312, Ohbiru's 308 (ohbiruProg 1) and 309, Kenapa's
# 310, Kerutoto's 313 refused (kerutotoProg 256), 314 refused, 314 accepted (begun, kerutotoProg 1). Accepted: Kerutoto's
# 315, the hare (332, 440: +440 gil, kerutotoProg 2), 333; Leepe's 311; Kenapa's 318 / 319 / 320 (kenapaProg 1-3), the
# random 320 / 321 / 328 at kenapaProg 3, a wrong item (329), the egg after the order (327, 120: +120 gil, kenapaProg 4
# with Ohbiru not done: the `kerutotoProg == 2 and ohbiruProg == 3` guard's second half false); Ohbiru's 316
# (ohbiruProg 2), 317, the three items after the order (322, 440: +440 gil, the other two done: completed with fame
# +20, Fast Food Deliverer, mustZone). Completed with mustZone: Kerutoto 304, Ohbiru 344 (replaceDefault; the same
# event as his default, so the fake checks the modifier).
# The start stands between Kenapa (2.7 yalms) and Ohbiru (3.0): a trade needs 6 yalms, and `trade` does not walk.
# Defaults: Kenapa's script plays 302 or 303 at random (math.randomInt; Hat in Hand's show-off needs the New Model Hat);
# Kerutoto 306 and Ohbiru 344 (DefaultActions; no scripts); Leepe-Hoppe's script answers only for Tuning In / Out (fame
# level 4 and a CoP mission; never here), and 311 is a progressEvent. Also named: Kenapa by Overnight Delivery (needs
# this quest completed and fame level 2) and Say It with Flowers (its Prog 1 only; its vars are 0 here); Ohbiru by
# those two and Water Way to Go (needs Overnight Delivery), Toraimarai Turmoil (Blue Ribbon Blues completed); Kerutoto by
# Blue Ribbon Blues and Waking Dreams (fame and level gated), LB04 (accepted only), CoP 5-3; Leepe by The Moonlit Path
# and Toraimarai Turmoil; Windurst missions 1-3 and 7-2 and CoP 3-3 (none current for a fresh Bastok char).
lists WindurstWaters/Kenapa-Keppa/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Kenapa-Keppa/onTrade WindurstWaters/Kerutoto/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Kerutoto/onTrade WindurstWaters/Ohbiru-Dohbiru/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Ohbiru-Dohbiru/onTrade WindurstWaters/Leepe-Hoppe/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/308 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/313 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/314 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/316 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/318 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/319 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/320 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/322 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/327 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/332
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=24.0,-5.38,-197.7
item HardBoiledEgg x2
item SliceOfGrilledHare x2
item CupOfWindurstianTea
item Tortilla
item ClumpOfPamtamKelp
item BoneChip
login
trade Kenapa-Keppa HardBoiledEgg x1     # available: no trade handler; his script has none: nothing
trade Ohbiru-Dohbiru BoneChip x1        # available: nothing
trigger Kerutoto                        # available, ohbiruProg 0: event 312
finish
trade Kerutoto BoneChip x1              # available: nothing
trigger Ohbiru-Dohbiru                  # ohbiruProg 0, SIWF Prog 0: 308
finish                                  # ohbiruProg 1
trigger Ohbiru-Dohbiru                  # ohbiruProg 1: 309 (no finish handler)
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # SIWF Option 0: 310 (no finish handler)
finish
trigger Kerutoto                        # ohbiruProg 1, kerutotoProg 0: 313 (0, 4371)
finish option=1                         # refused: kerutotoProg 256
trigger Kerutoto                        # ohbiruProg 1, kerutotoProg 256: 314 (0, 4371)
finish option=1                         # not 0: nothing
trigger Kerutoto                        # 314 again
finish option=0                         # begun, kerutotoProg 1
trigger Kerutoto                        # accepted, kerutotoProg 1: 315 (0, Slice of Grilled Hare)
finish
trade Kerutoto BoneChip x1              # not the hare: nil
trade Kerutoto SliceOfGrilledHare x1 BoneChip x1  # the hare and a chip: not exactly the hare, nil
trade Kerutoto SliceOfGrilledHare x1    # exactly the hare, kerutotoProg 1: 332 (440)
finish                                  # the hare taken, +440 gil; kenapaProg 0, ohbiruProg 1: kerutotoProg 2
trigger Kerutoto                        # kerutotoProg 2: 333
finish
trade Kerutoto SliceOfGrilledHare x1    # the hare, kerutotoProg 2: nil
trigger Leepe-Hoppe                     # accepted: 311
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # kenapaProg 0: 318
finish                                  # kenapaProg 1
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # 319
finish                                  # kenapaProg 2
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # 320 (0, Hard-Boiled Egg)
finish                                  # kenapaProg 3
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # kenapaProg 3: randomInt(1, 3): 1 = 320, 2 = 321, 3 = 328
finish                                  # (a 320 sets kenapaProg 3 again)
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # the next draw
finish
trade Kenapa-Keppa BoneChip x1          # not the egg: 329 (no finish handler)
finish
trade Kenapa-Keppa HardBoiledEgg x1 BoneChip x1  # the egg and a chip: not exactly the egg, 329
finish
trade Kenapa-Keppa HardBoiledEgg x1     # exactly the egg, kenapaProg 3: 327 (120)
finish                                  # the egg taken, +120 gil; kerutotoProg 2 but ohbiruProg 1: kenapaProg 4
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # kenapaProg 4: nil; his script 302 or 303
finish
trade Kenapa-Keppa HardBoiledEgg x1     # the egg, kenapaProg 4: neither arm, nil
trigger Ohbiru-Dohbiru                  # ohbiruProg 1 (< 2): 316 (0, 4493, 624, 4408)
finish                                  # ohbiruProg 2
trigger Ohbiru-Dohbiru                  # ohbiruProg 2: 317 (0, 4493, 624, 4408)
finish
trade Ohbiru-Dohbiru BoneChip x1        # not the three: nil
trade Ohbiru-Dohbiru CupOfWindurstianTea x1 Tortilla x1  # two of the three: nil
trade Ohbiru-Dohbiru CupOfWindurstianTea x1 Tortilla x1 ClumpOfPamtamKelp x1 BoneChip x1  # the three and a chip: nil
trade Ohbiru-Dohbiru CupOfWindurstianTea x1 Tortilla x1 ClumpOfPamtamKelp x1  # exactly the three, ohbiruProg 2: 322 (440)
finish                                  # taken, +440 gil; kerutotoProg 2 and kenapaProg 4: completed (fame +20, Fast Food Deliverer), vars cleared, mustZone 238
trigger Kerutoto                        # completed, mustZone: 304 (replaceDefault)
finish
trade Kerutoto SliceOfGrilledHare x1    # completed: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Ohbiru-Dohbiru                  # completed, mustZone: 344 (replaceDefault)
finish
rezone                                  # the mustZone cleared
trigger Kerutoto                        # no section: his default 306
finish
trigger Ohbiru-Dohbiru                  # no section: his default 344
finish
trigger Kenapa-Keppa                    # Overnight Delivery needs fame level 2 (fame 20): his script 302 or 303
finish
